a little late tonight.

177
00:08:37,380 --> 00:08:39,097
Ah, don't worry about that.

178
00:08:39,180 --> 00:08:40,474
I can take care of it.

179
00:08:40,660 --> 00:08:42,760
You go on and get to Cardi. Right.

180
00:08:42,940 --> 00:08:43,770
Thanks, Matt.

181
00:08:44,140 --> 00:08:44,970
Oh, I forgot.

182
00:08:45,053 --> 00:08:47,777
I left Mimi on hold when
she called from New York.

183
00:08:47,860 --> 00:08:48,940
