184
00:08:49,200 --> 00:08:51,457
I told my mom we were
working on a rescue project.

185
00:08:51,540 --> 00:08:53,837
She said she's glad we're helping
stray cats in the neighborhood.

186
00:08:53,920 --> 00:08:57,979
Yeah, my dad was just glad that I
left without filling up another bag

187
00:09:01,180 --> 00:09:03,657
There's just one guard at the door We're

188
00:09:03,740 --> 00:09:05,957
