out in the first attack.

189
00:09:06,040 --> 00:09:09,197
Otherwise, he'll call for
reinforcements Not a problem.

190
00:09:09,280 --> 00:09:11,457
Vimon and I can handle that metalhead.

191
00:09:11,540 --> 00:09:12,775
Vimon, are you ready?

192
00:09:13,200 --> 00:09:14,500
Yeah, let's do it.

193
00:09:14,600 --> 00:09:16,188
Did y 'all - Wait a minute.

194
00:09:16,720 --> 00:09:17,550
I'll do it.

195
00:09:17,680 --> 00:09:20,197
There aren't any control
spires in this area, right?

196
00:09:20,280 --> 00:09:22,500
Well, just the one inside the dome

197
00:09:23,920 --> 00:09:28,780
But we're outside yeah, that's
right that means you can digivolve

198
