Hi there, big guy.

201
00:10:23,920 --> 00:10:24,880
Angel Rod!

202
00:10:25,640 --> 00:10:26,540
Angel Roder!

203
00:10:31,100 --> 00:10:32,460
I nailed it.

204
00:10:47,880 --> 00:10:51,357
You know those control
spires really ruined my day.

205
00:10:51,440 --> 00:10:52,880
You did great, Patamon.

206
00:10:53,080 --> 00:10:56,980
So, besides armor digivolving,
Patamon can digivolve to Angiemon?

207
00:10:57,280 --> 00:10:58,440
