210
00:11:03,020 --> 00:11:06,000
Angewomon and Angewomon? That's right.

211
00:11:06,260 --> 00:11:08,480
We make a great team. One question.

212
00:11:08,680 --> 00:11:10,445
Is there an Angiebabymon, too?

213
00:11:11,180 --> 00:11:13,460
Sometimes he says the weirdest things.

214
00:11:15,100 --> 00:11:16,700
V-mon! Huh?

215
00:11:17,620 --> 00:11:21,157
Tell me right now if you can
digivolve an Angie-something, too.

216
00:11:21,240 --> 00:11:24,220
Uh, Angie Dinosaurmon,
Angie Soccerplayermon!

217
00:11:24,680 --> 00:11:26,300
I just don't have it in me!

218
00:11:26,740 --> 00:11:28,505
He's still got a lot to learn.

219
00:11:30,840 --> 00:11:31,670
So anyway,

220
00:11:31,880 --> 00:11:33,397
Davis is over at my brother's house,

221
00:11:33,480 --> 00:11:36,833
and so he probably won't be
home until a little later on.

222
00:11:38,560 --> 00:11:39,390
What?

223
00:11:39,480 --> 00:11:40,400
You're lying.

224
00:11:41,200 --> 00:11:42,030
Huh?

225
00:11:42,113 --> 00:11:45,377
I can tell when people are lying, because
they usually start blinking a lot.

226
00:11:45,460 --> 00:11:46,290
What?

227
00:11:47,500 --> 00:11:49,657
I promise not to tell my
parents you were lying

228
00:11:49,740 --> 00:11:51,517
if you promise to go
out on a date with me,

229
00:11:51,600 --> 00:11:52,430
okay?

230
00:11:52,513 --> 00:11:53,343
See you Friday at 8.

231
00:11:54,920 --> 00:11:56,320
How did that happen?

232
00:12:00,320 --> 00:12:02,849
How come you get some
more candy than I do?

233
00:12:02,960 --> 00:12:05,195
Stop complaining, there's plenty more.

234
00:12:06,080 --> 00:12:07,920
I brought some reinforcements.

235
00:12:08,220 --> 00:12:09,279
Let's get to work.

236
00:12:12,620 --> 00:12:14,444
You summoned me, Your Highness.

237
00:12:14,780 --> 00:12:16,857
Please hold for the Digimon Emperor.

238
00:12:16,940 --> 00:12:18,234
Line one for you, sir.

239
00:12:39,180 --> 00:12:42,540
We are energize!

240
00:12:43,240 --> 00:12:44,180
Digimon!

241
00:12:44,760 --> 00:12:47,180
Beemon Armor Digimon!

242
00:12:50,720 --> 00:12:53,360
Patamon, Armored Digimon, go!

243
00:12:56,720 --> 00:12:58,800
Armored Digimon!

244
00:13:03,180 --> 00:13:09,580
Digimon, Digital Monsters,
Glendramon, the Fire of Courage!

245
00:13:11,460 --> 00:13:16,740
Digimon, Digital Monsters,
Pegasmon, Flying Hope!

246
00:13:17,540 --> 00:13:18,580
Fire Rocket!

247
00:13:22,640 --> 00:13:23,470
Davis,

248
00:13:23,553 --> 00:13:26,777
over here I can't jump as
high as you can I'm getting

249
00:13:26,860 --> 00:13:31,620
Kari's signal We're close You
ready to jump a little higher?

250
00:13:32,320 --> 00:13:36,217
It really doesn't matter
what you try It's getting

251
00:13:36,300 --> 00:13:41,220
even harder to deny Cause
reality has just said goodbye

252
00:13:44,940 --> 00:13:45,770
Rene destroyer

253
00:13:49,740 --> 00:13:50,570
No!

254
00:13:50,653 --> 00:13:52,051
It's getting ready to go!

255
00:13:53,260 --> 00:13:56,020
It starts happening all over again!

256
00:13:57,080 --> 00:13:58,440
Intruder destroyed!

257
00:14:00,920 --> 00:14:01,960
Equus B!

258
00:14:02,260 --> 00:14:03,260
Fire rocket!

259
00:14:08,980 --> 00:14:10,940
Hey, Davis! TK!

260
00:14:11,220 --> 00:14:12,573
You guys are my heroes!

261
00:14:12,700 --> 00:14:16,877
Actually, it was mostly my idea, but I
decided to bring TK out for the ride!

262
00:14:16,960 --> 00:14:17,790
Whatever.

263
